# =====================
# One-off script run artifacts
# =====================
# Recovery dumps written by the content rewrite/migration scripts before they
# write to Firestore. Kept on disk as a local undo path, but not versioned:
# they are large content dumps (megabytes), and the same prior state is also
# stored in each document's own `previousVersions` field.
scripts/*-backup-*.json
scripts/*-dryrun-*.json
scripts/*-applied-*.json
scripts/reward-ledger-audit-*.json
scripts/score-migration-applied-*.json
scripts/clamp-negative-balances-*.json

# =====================
# Migration / authoring run artifacts
# =====================
# Every admin script under scripts/ that mutates Firestore writes a timestamped
# dry-run or applied-changes record next to itself (see write-gate-lessons.mjs,
# rewrite-cscore-lessons.mjs, the reward-migration scripts). Those files are local
# recovery and audit artifacts for one run on one machine - useful to keep on disk,
# never useful in history, and they accumulate fast.
scripts/*-backup-*.json
scripts/*-dryrun-*.json
scripts/*-applied-*.json
scripts/*-audit-*.json
scripts/reward-ledger-audit-*.json
scripts/clamp-negative-balances-*.json
scripts/disallowed-module-rewards-*.json
scripts/duplicate-rewards-*.json
scripts/new-dsa-problems-migration-*.json
scripts/problem-structure-migration-*.json
scripts/retroactive-daily-learning-rewards-*.json
scripts/reverse-premature-conversions-*.json
scripts/score-migration-*.json

# Scratch lint output
devert-frontend/eslint_fresh.json

